{"availability":"available","full":"petewritescode/contraction-timer","name":"contraction-timer","description":"A minimalist web app for tracking and timing your contractions during labour.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":3,"created":"2020-02-26T21:08:28Z","updated":"2023-07-07T23:29:01Z","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["progressive-web-app","react","redux","typescript"],"demo":"https://contractions.netlify.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T01:09:46.539Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T01:09:46.539Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T01:09:46.539Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T01:09:46.539Z","stars":9,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A minimalist web app for timing and tracking labour contractions."],"features":["Get real-time stats - Time your current contraction or rest period, and take a break at any time. One hour averages, used to determine your labour stage, are continuously calculated and prominently displayed.","At-a-glance updates - Each timer state has a distinctive background colour, giving you corner-of-the-eye information and allowing you to stay focused on your partner.","Jump straight in - Runs in the browser on any device without installation or registration, allowing you to get started at a moment's notice. Or add it to your device's home screen for quick, full-screen access.","Never lose anything - Your data is mirrored to local storage for peace of mind. Close your browser, use other apps or even restart your phone - the timer will keep running and your contraction history will be safe."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/petewritescode/contraction-timer/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"8a6800da71943f19faa193e7c59170fb6499b1ea30b4934446f38654f0e65299","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T01:09:46.696Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T01:09:46.696Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A minimalist web app for timin